Third-party software in CableBox
================================

The cablebox program is built from CableBox's own source (GPL-2.0-or-later) and the
Rust crates below, which are compiled into it. Their licenses and notices follow.
System libraries it loads (libmpv, libinput, libgbm, libudev, libxkbcommon and their
dependencies) come from separate Debian packages with their own copyright files.

